      "text": "When all four dice show the same number, it can only be 6. Therefore, there are 6 times when this occurs:\n\nP(all same) = 6 / (6 * 6 * 6 * 6) = 6 / 1296 = 1 / 216.\n\nTherefore, the probability of them all not showing the same number is 1 minus the probability of them all showing the same number:\n\nP(not all same) = 1 - 1 / 216 = 215 / 216.",
